                                "sense_id": "9cbc887e-4f77-39d0-89e6-3f8294323d21",
                                "text": "Whoever rises up in the morning, with a mornlike freshness of piety in thought, will praise the name of Jefferson, and through it the name of Jehovah."
                            },
